					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Indeed neat - this uses a concept i myself thought was scary and have done it with a failed parasite (because it had it just as a side thing). Upvoted.</p> <p>There's one thing that bugs me - the last explanation. If the effect would be memetic, and tied to the text, the fact that it's a transcript would be irrelevant.<br /> You might , rather want to say that said foreword (perhaps printed at back of book?) isn't the memetic carrier, or that the carrier isn't the text but rather paper texture or some such stuff</p> 
				 	]]>
